            "sid": "JER 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to me in the days of King Josiah: “Have you seen what she did, that faithless one, Israel, how she went up on every high hill and under every green tree, and there played the harlot? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I thought, ‘After she has done all this she will return to me’; but she did not return, and her false sister Judah saw it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She saw that for all the adulteries of that faithless one, Israel, I had sent her away with a decree of divorce; yet her false sister Judah did not fear, but she too went and played the harlot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because harlotry was so light to her, she polluted the land, committing adultery with stone and tree. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet for all this her false sister Judah did not return to me with her whole heart, but in pretense, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to me, “Faithless Israel has shown herself less guilty than false Judah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go, and proclaim these words toward the north, and say,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘And I will give you shepherds after my own heart, who will feed you with knowledge and understanding. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when you have multiplied and increased in the land, in those days, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", they shall no more say, “The ark of the covenant of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".” It shall not come to mind, or be remembered, or missed; it shall not be made again. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At that time Jerusalem shall be called the throne of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and all nations shall gather to it, to the presence of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in Jerusalem, and they shall no more stubbornly follow their own evil heart. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In those days the house of Judah shall join the house of Israel, and together they shall come from the land of the north to the land that I gave your fathers for a heritage.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“But from our youth the shameful thing has devoured all for which our fathers labored, their flocks and their herds, their sons and their daughters. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let us lie down in our shame, and let our dishonor cover us; for we have sinned against the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God, we and our fathers, from our youth even to this day; and we have not obeyed the voice of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
